# <type>(<ticket-id>): <short summary>
#
# Example:
# feat(zg-0001): add config loader
#
# Types:
# feat:     new feature
# fix:      bug fix
# docs:     documentation only
# test:     tests only
# refactor: code change that neither fixes a bug nor adds a feature
# chore:    build, tooling, maintenance, or repo housekeeping
#
# Ticket ID:
# Mandatory. Use zg- followed by exactly 4 numbers, for example zg-0001.
#
# Body:
# Explain what changed and why. Wrap lines at around 72 characters.
#
# Footer:
# BREAKING CHANGE: describe incompatible changes
# Closes: #123
